==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* [[seatbelt]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[seat]] [[belt]]}}

# A restraining belt attached to a vehicle seat which is fastened around [[passenger]]s and which is intended to keep an [[occupant]] in place so as to avoid death or injuries in accidents where the occupant could be thrown against a solid object or even ejected from the vehicle. It also ensures the occupant is correctly positioned for the airbag in the front seats.

